  "signal_basis": {
    "component_id": "C052_signal_basis",
    "value": "Confident midpoint classifications determine which endpoint moves and which history is discarded under a single-transition assumption. Inconclusive results do not justify elimination, and build failures are not performance classifications; decisive results shrink the candidate interval.",
